## ⚙️ Smart Contract Features

- **Proxy Upgradeable** – Allows future improvements without breaking integrations
- **Anti-Sell Protection** – Blocks transfers to/from Uniswap V2/V3 pools until removed by the team, preventing early whale manipulation
- **Peg Price System** – Adjustable by the owner to maintain the $1,900 USD peg
- **Ownership Controls** – Clear separation of technical and financial responsibilities
- **Fully Verified** – Verified on [Etherscan](https://etherscan.io/token/0x25f2aabC1180DddAF5a859Be517dDA6dEC418773) and [Blockscout](https://eth.blockscout.com/token/0x25f2aabC1180DddAF5a859Be517dDA6dEC418773)

